<title>USA: Sungard data q3 pro forma shr $0.41 vs $0.</title>
<headline>Sungard data q3 pro forma shr $0.41 vs $0.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   Nine Months	    Three Months</p>
<p>				 1996	  1995	1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues		 $477,012    $378,723 $171,646  $132,114</p>
<p> Net income (1)	   48,673	36,698   17,822    13,359</p>
<p>Pro forma fully diluted net income</p>
<p>  per common share (1)    1.13	  0.95     0.41	0.34</p>
<p> Net income, reported   20,386	35,347 ($10,465)   12,008</p>
<p> Per share net, reported  0.47     0.91(2)  $(0.24)  $0.31(2)</p>
<p>Fully diluted average shares outstand</p>
<p>				43,138   38,649(2)  43,230  39,254(2)</p>
<p>(1) Excludes charges for purchased in-process research and development related to the acquisition of NCS Financial Systems Inc and other one-time charges of $44,032 ($28,287 after-tax, or $0.66 per share) in 1996 and merger costs of $1,351 (both before and after-tax, representing $0.03 per share) in 1995.</p>
<p>(2) Adjusted to reflect two-for-one stock split which occurred in July 1995. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
